  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LOOP Forum 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The LOOP Festival 2024 is set to take place on Wednesday 28 and Thursday 29 February, in parallel to the 6th United Nations Environment Assembly (UNEA-6) in Nairobi. The event will bring together public and private companies, development partners, and learning &amp; research institutions involved in circular economy to showcase innovative design and sustainability. 

The 2-day conference and expo will aim at targeting at 40 exhibitors and attracting 120 conference guests. .</narrative>
  </description>
